      "y": -350,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 140,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83c\udf10 Topologia TechSolutions \u2014 Switching Avan\u00e7ado\n**Aluno:** Matheus Sousa dos Santos | **RA:** 52319400\n**Arquitetura:** 2 Switches Core (LACP EtherChannel) + 2 Switches Acesso + 6 PCs + 2 IP Phones",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sw_core_1",
      "x": -250,
      "y": -140,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 180,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udfe2 SW-CORE-1 (Cisco 3560)\n- **Port-Channel 1:** `mode active`\n- **Interfaces:** Gig0/1 + Gig0/2\n- **Modo:** 802.1Q Trunk\n- **Native VLAN:** 99 | **Allowed:** 10,20,30,40,99\n- **Downlink:** Fa0/1 $\\rightarrow$ SW-ACCESS-1",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "sw_core_2",
      "x": 150,
      "y": -140,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 180,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udfe2 SW-CORE-2 (Cisco 3560)\n- **Port-Channel 1:** `mode passive`\n- **Interfaces:** Gig0/1 + Gig0/2\n- **Modo:** 802.1Q Trunk\n- **Native VLAN:** 99 | **Allowed:** 10,20,30,40,99\n- **Downlink:** Fa0/1 $\\rightarrow$ SW-ACCESS-2",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "sw_acc_1",
      "x": -250,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 180,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udfec SW-ACCESS-1 (Cisco 3560)\n- **Uplink:** Gig0/1 (Trunk Nativa 99)\n- **Fa0/2:** Access VLAN 10 (PC-ADM-01)\n- **Fa0/3:** Access VLAN 20 (PC-FIN-01)\n- **Fa0/4:** Access VLAN 30 (PC-TI-01)\n- **Fa0/5:** Access 10 + Voice VLAN 40",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "sw_acc_2",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 180,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udfec SW-ACCESS-2 (Cisco 3560)\n- **Uplink:** Gig0/1 (Trunk Nativa 99)\n- **Fa0/2:** Access VLAN 10 (PC-ADM-02)\n- **Fa0/3:** Access VLAN 20 (PC-FIN-02)\n- **Fa0/4:** Access VLAN 30 (PC-TI-02)\n- **Fa0/5:** Access 10 + Voice VLAN 40",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
