      "x": -250,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 200,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udcbb Hosts do Setor 1\n- `PC-ADM-01`: 192.168.10.11 /24 (Fa0/2)\n- `PC-FIN-01`: 192.168.20.11 /24 (Fa0/3)\n- `PC-TI-01`: 192.168.30.11 /24 (Fa0/4)\n- `IP-PHONE-01`: Voice VLAN 40 (Fa0/5)\n- Gateway Padr\u00e3o: 192.168.X.1",
      "color": "6"
